            title = "Meet Your Workbench"
            description = ["This is your pack workbench — the tabs at the top switch between its parts.", "Quests — the quest book you're reading right now. Recipes — add and edit crafting recipes. Configs — tweak config files safely. Behaviors — automate things while playing. Loot — control what chests and mobs drop. Mods — find and install mods. Health — checks your pack for problems.", "Click through every tab, then check me off."]
